        "At national level, equivalence certificates for the IB Diploma and IGCSE-based qualifications come from the Association of Indian Universities, central universities largely admit through CUET-UG whatever the board, and JEE Main, JEE Advanced and NEET-UG spell out their own subject and marks rules in each year's bulletin. The IITs and the University of Hyderabad draw many Andhra applicants, and private universities in the Amaravati region are within a day's reach of Vijayawada.",
